  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/07/RinaInfantilSuera15estelaLeonGarcia.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 853px;\" /></p>\n<p>Estela Le&oacute;n Garc&iacute;a, que viu a Vinar&ograve;s per&ograve; descendeix de Suera, ser&aacute; la reina infantil 2015, segons ha determinat el sorteig celebrat aquest diumenge al sal&oacute; de plens de l&#39;Ajuntament. Estela es trobava fora de viatge i ha sigut sa tia la que ha tret la papereta de la sort. L&#39;acompanyaran com a dametes d&#39;honor Alicia Sargsyam Serrano, que tindr&agrave; d&#39;acompanyant a Ismael Peris Casta&ntilde;, i Mireia Albalat Medrano. L&#39;acte de proclamaci&oacute; de la reina infantil ser&agrave; el primer divendres de festes d&#39;agost, dia 7, quan Estela substituir&agrave; en el c&agrave;rrec a Denisa Neacsu Nae, que tamb&eacute; estava present a l&#39;acte, juntament amb la reina major, Claudia Ortells Sorribes, l&#39;alcalde, Jos&eacute; Mart&iacute; Garcia, i altres membres de la Corporaci&oacute; Municipal, aix&iacute; com integrants de la Comissi&oacute; de Festes 2015.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110705.jpg\" alt=\"p1110705\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110707.jpg\" alt=\"p1110707\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110708.jpg\" alt=\"p1110708\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110709.jpg\" alt=\"p1110709\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110710.jpg\" alt=\"p1110710\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110711.jpg\" alt=\"p1110711\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110714.jpg\" alt=\"p1110714\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110716.jpg\" alt=\"p1110716\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110717.jpg\" alt=\"p1110717\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110718.jpg\" alt=\"p1110718\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110719.jpg\" alt=\"p1110719\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110720.jpg\" alt=\"p1110720\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110723.jpg\" alt=\"p1110723\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110724.jpg\" alt=\"p1110724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110726.jpg\" alt=\"p1110726\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110728.jpg\" alt=\"p1110728\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfatilsuera15/p1110730.jpg\" alt=\"p1110730\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f